## [2026-07-09] Hide /subscription untuk tenant sales (self-service flag)

**Author:** synckerja-web (CMS admin)  
**Status apply Supabase:** Sudah apply  

### Ringkasan

Menambah kolom `organizations.subscription_self_service_enabled` (default `true`) agar CMS dapat menandai tenant sales (`false`). Saat `false`, **synckerja office** harus menyembunyikan seluruh modul `/subscription` untuk semua role termasuk Owner, sambil tetap memblokir akses saat subscription expired.

### File migration

| File | Jenis |
|------|-------|
| `supabase/migrations/20260709210000_organizations_subscription_self_service.sql` | ADD column |
| `supabase/migrations/20260709210100_admin_organization_settings_rpc.sql` | ADD RPC + extend `admin_list_organizations` |

### Objek database

**Kolom baru**
- `public.organizations.subscription_self_service_enabled` — `boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT true`

**RPC baru / diubah**
- `admin_update_organization_settings(p_organization_id, p_subscription_self_service_enabled, p_reason)` — guard `is_cms_admin()`, audit ke `cms_subscription_adjustments` (`before_state`/`after_state` berisi flag)
- `admin_list_organizations(...)` — return tambahan `subscription_self_service_enabled`

### Dampak ke synckerja (office) — wajib deploy

**Status implementasi di repo synckerja:** sudah ada (Fase 3 selesai).

| Area | File |
|------|------|
| Helper path subscription | `src/10-subscription/shared/subscriptionSelfService.ts` |
| Hook flag org | `src/shared/auth/hooks/useSubscriptionSelfServiceEnabled.ts` |
| Block route + owner | `src/shared/auth/page-access/useDepartmentAccess.ts` |
| Role guard | `src/10-subscription/shared/SubscriptionRoleGuard.tsx` |
| Expiry policy | `src/10-subscription/shared/subscriptionExpiryPolicy.ts` |
| Expiry guard | `src/10-subscription/shared/SubscriptionExpiryGuard.tsx` |
| Banner | `src/10-subscription/hooks/useSubscriptionExpiryBanner.ts` |
| Hide nav | `src/shared/layouts/sidebar/AppSidebar.tsx` |

- RLS existing pada `organizations`: **tidak diubah**
- Kolom dibaca via `useSubscriptionSelfServiceEnabled` (default `true` jika belum load)
- Default `true` untuk org existing dan self-register onboarding

**Path yang disembunyikan:** `/subscription`, `/subscription/overview`, `/subscription/plans`, `/subscription/management`

### Yang harus dilakukan tim synckerja

1. ~~Copy 2 file migration~~ — sudah ada di `supabase/migrations/`
2. ~~Apply Supabase shared~~ — sudah apply dari synckerja-web
3. **Deploy office** jika production belum ter-update
